    "detailed_description": "<h1>Original Soundtrack</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an original soundtrack (<strong>OST</strong>) created by <strong>Honywood Lofi</strong>, an independent music studio.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vespia: Shield of Aberration is a <strong>tower-defense game</strong> where you <strong>combine spells</strong> to <strong>modify the effects</strong> of your projectiles. In this game, it is not the tower that defines its magic power, but how you choose to apply modifications to it. Create a shotgun wizard by combining multi-casts, create shots that explode into a burst of black holes, and absolutely break the game with your insane combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vespia, you will be tasked with <strong>protecting the city for 20 days</strong> before a powerful <strong>prime anomaly</strong> appears. During this time you will earn experience, upgrade your characters and unlock new spells - slack off and the increasing amount and types of enemies will be bound to overrun you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each day, you will have the option to <strong>unlock special modifier effects</strong> which add a little bit of interest to your run; however, <strong>the more powerful the benefits, the more powerful the consequences</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/e5ea737ebf3b0b408e78fd1a6aea48b2.poster.avif?t=1755083161\" width=602 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/e5ea737ebf3b0b408e78fd1a6aea48b2.webm?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/e5ea737ebf3b0b408e78fd1a6aea48b2.mp4?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey cannot be completed alone, each new student joining your party will bring something new to the table with unique abilities, spells and upgrade trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new character that you unlock has:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique skill tree for that character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An upgradable ability card active while you are using that character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-specific cards to enhance your deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/8dd4dc4a610c9db5c0c686eceff34f31.poster.avif?t=1755083161\" width=602 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/8dd4dc4a610c9db5c0c686eceff34f31.webm?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/8dd4dc4a610c9db5c0c686eceff34f31.mp4?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battle, each student can be given modifier cards that bring them closer to mastering the anomalous and becoming an unstoppable force.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells interact with other spells, creating an expansive range of combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifier spells modify the fired projectiles with effects like swift-cast and freeze-shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells change how your spells are triggered with effects like multi-shot and burst.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Projectile spells spawn projectiles that can damage anomalous threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/6d56d4fdb4c83ac232a8d7d70691d746.poster.avif?t=1755083161\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/6d56d4fdb4c83ac232a8d7d70691d746.webm?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/6d56d4fdb4c83ac232a8d7d70691d746.mp4?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each battle, perform research to gain new cards which unlock an exponential number of formidable combinations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cards unlock powerful and interesting new spells.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards are designed with interesting effects in mind, some may upgrade your characters, others may grant some great boon at the cost of  sacrificing something else.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/90273600af72debe33f5917ef6d8ea0c.poster.avif?t=1755083161\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/90273600af72debe33f5917ef6d8ea0c.webm?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/90273600af72debe33f5917ef6d8ea0c.mp4?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle requires a different set of skills. Each card provides something unique, from cards which enhance a student's powers to ones that sacrifice or enhance the cards in your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/2933822ce307c10ccd891ed90710030c.avif?t=1755083161\" width=690 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days progress and the intensity of their attacks intensify, the world beings to distort and the threats become greater. You feel like something is waiting for you...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vespia: Shield of Aberration is a <strong>tower-defense game</strong> where you <strong>combine spells</strong> to <strong>modify the effects</strong> of your projectiles. In this game, it is not the tower that defines its magic power, but how you choose to apply modifications to it. Create a shotgun wizard by combining multi-casts, create shots that explode into a burst of black holes, and absolutely break the game with your insane combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vespia, you will be tasked with <strong>protecting the city for 20 days</strong> before a powerful <strong>prime anomaly</strong> appears. During this time you will earn experience, upgrade your characters and unlock new spells - slack off and the increasing amount and types of enemies will be bound to overrun you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each day, you will have the option to <strong>unlock special modifier effects</strong> which add a little bit of interest to your run; however, <strong>the more powerful the benefits, the more powerful the consequences</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/e5ea737ebf3b0b408e78fd1a6aea48b2.poster.avif?t=1755083161\" width=602 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/e5ea737ebf3b0b408e78fd1a6aea48b2.webm?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/e5ea737ebf3b0b408e78fd1a6aea48b2.mp4?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey cannot be completed alone, each new student joining your party will bring something new to the table with unique abilities, spells and upgrade trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new character that you unlock has:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique skill tree for that character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An upgradable ability card active while you are using that character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-specific cards to enhance your deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/8dd4dc4a610c9db5c0c686eceff34f31.poster.avif?t=1755083161\" width=602 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/8dd4dc4a610c9db5c0c686eceff34f31.webm?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/8dd4dc4a610c9db5c0c686eceff34f31.mp4?t=1755083161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battle, each student can be given modifier cards that bring them closer to mastering the anomalous and becoming an unstoppable force.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells interact with other spells, creating an expansive range of combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifier spells modify the fired projectiles with effects like swift-cast and freeze-shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells change how your spells are triggered with effects like multi-shot and burst.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Projectile spells spawn projectiles that can damage anomalous threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304820/extras/6d56d4fdb